<view class="page">
  <view class="hero"><text class="title">本人题目收藏</text><text class="muted">只保存原题引用，不永久复制题干、答案或图片。回顾重新核对当前开放；收藏不判断一道题一定做错，也不改变首答、成绩或掌握度。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" aria-role="alert">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}</view><text wx:if="{{busy}}">正在重新核对…</text>
  <view wx:if="{{target}}" class="card"><text class="heading">当前选中的冻结题目</text><text>{{target.current && target.current.collected ? '已收藏' : '未收藏'}}{{target.current ? ' · v' + target.current.version : ''}}</text>
    <text wx:if="{{target.changed}}" class="error">来源版本或开放条件已变化，请返回原结果重新核对；仍可取消已有收藏。</text><text wx:elif="{{!target.canCollect}}" class="muted">当前不满足完整讲评或收藏授权，不能新增收藏。已有收藏不能补全受限内容。</text>
    <button bindtap="set" disabled="{{busy || (!target.canCollect && (!target.current || !target.current.collected))}}">{{target.current && target.current.collected ? '确认取消此题收藏' : '确认收藏此题引用'}}</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{pendingTotal}}" class="card"><text class="heading">待确认操作（共 {{pendingTotal}} 项）</text><text class="muted">这里只保留标识、原基准和动作，不含题目正文。查询不到不代表失败；明确重试仍使用原号及原请求。</text>
    <view wx:for="{{pending}}" wx:key="operationId" class="card"><text>{{item.wanted ? '收藏' : '取消收藏'}} · {{item.operationId}}</text><button bindtap="pendingAction" data-kind="recover" data-id="{{item.operationId}}" disabled="{{busy}}">查询原操作回执</button><button bindtap="pendingAction" data-kind="retry" data-id="{{item.operationId}}" disabled="{{busy}}">明确重试同一请求</button><button bindtap="pendingAction" data-kind="abandon" data-id="{{item.operationId}}" disabled="{{busy}}">核对风险后关闭本机追踪</button></view>
    <view class="pager"><button bindtap="page" data-kind="pending" data-direction="-1" disabled="{{busy || pendingOffset === 0}}">上一页操作</button><button bindtap="page" data-kind="pending" data-direction="1" disabled="{{busy || pendingOffset + 20 >= pendingTotal}}">下一页操作</button></view>
  </view>
  <view class="card" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id"><text class="heading">{{item.title}}</text><text>收藏于 {{item.at}} · v{{item.version}}</text><text>{{item.available ? '当前可回原结果核对完整讲评' : '当前来源未获准读取；仅保留引用记录，不展示旧题干或答案'}}</text><button bindtap="open" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">返回原结果核对</button><button bindtap="set" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">确认取消收藏</button></view>
  <text wx:if="{{!busy && !total}}" class="muted">当前学校暂无收藏，不代表没有错题或学习问题。</text><text>共 {{total}} 项；每页最多 20 项。</text>
  <view class="pager"><button bindtap="page" data-direction="-1" disabled="{{busy || offset === 0}}">上一页收藏</button><button bindtap="page" data-direction="1" disabled="{{busy || offset + 20 >= total}}">下一页收藏</button></view><button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">重新读取当前收藏</button>
</view>
